dsh-guikit-remote
=================

This plugin is a derivative work of **dsh-guikit** v0.6.2
(https://github.com/gezi-wen/dsh-guikit), Copyright (c) gezi-wen,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The PowerShell execution layer (P/Invoke helpers, UIA walkers, screenshot
rulers and the coordinate-space contract) is inherited from dsh-guikit.
This fork replaces the local `pwsh` subprocess execution with remote
execution through the windows-mcp streamable-http MCP server
(https://github.com/CursorTouch/Windows-MCP) plus scp screenshot transfer,
and adds the `gui_vision` tool with a host/server GPU switch.

Both upstream projects are credited above; no other third-party artwork is
included (icon.svg is original).
